sequenceDiagram
    participant D as 设计节点
    participant B as Bridge(协调服务)
    participant X as Codex 审阅者<br/>gpt-6-astra / xhigh
    D->>B: stage set design_review --plan plan.md
    B-->>D: requestId + 已提交 plan 的 blob SHA + 指定审阅模型
    loop 每一轮(共 3 轮)
        D->>X: 审阅 plan.md(只读)
        X-->>D: 判定 + findings
        D->>B: review-round design --round n --verdict …
        alt CHANGES_REQUESTED
            D->>D: 修 plan → 提交 → 重新 stage set design_review
        end
    end
    D->>B: design-review.json(APPROVED, round 3)
    D->>B: await-codex-gate design(fail-closed 校验)
    B-->>D: 通过 → 允许进入实施
